  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME is the premium variant of other co-branded cards offered by Landmark and SBI Card. The card offers **6.25% value-back on spends at Landmark stores** , including Lifestyle, Home Centre, Max, Spar, Babyshop, and EasyBuy. Besides this, it also offers **2.5% value-back on dining and movies** , making it a suitable option for everyday spends. However, cardholders can redeem accumulated reward points only at Landmark stores, at a value of **1 RP = Rs. 0.25**. Apart from shopping, this credit card also caters to frequent travellers with **5X rewards on international spends** along with complimentary **domestic and international lounge visits**. However, it charges a high forex markup fee of 3.5%, which almost nullifies the value gained from 5X rewards on international spends. In addition to this, it offers welcome and renewal **benefits worth Rs. 3,000 every year** , along with a milestone benefit of **20,000 bonus reward points**. Overall, this credit card is a suitable option for consumers seeking decent value-back at Landmark stores along with reasonable travel and everyday benefits.",
