    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "What is the difference between Landmark Rewards SBI Card, Landmark Rewards SBI Card Select, and Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME?",
        "a": "Landmark Rewards SBI Card is the entry-level variant offering basic value-back at Landmark stores. The Select variant offers higher rewards on shopping and a few additional benefits. The PRIME variant is the premium option, offering the highest value-back, milestone benefits, lounge access, and accelerated rewards on everyday spends."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I redeem reward points earned through Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME against cashback?",
        "a": "No, reward points earned through Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME cannot be redeemed against cashback. They can only be redeemed at Landmark partner stores at a value of 1 RP = Rs. 0.25."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME offer complimentary lounge visits?",
        "a": "Yes, Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME offers complimentary domestic and international lounge visits. The card offers 8 complimentary domestic airport lounge visits every year and complimentary Priority Pass Membership with 4 complimentary international lounge visits per year."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME good for travel?",
        "a": "The card offers lounge access and 5X reward points on international spends, which makes it a decent option for frequent travellers. However, its high forex markup fee of 3.5% reduces the overall benefit, making it a moderate option for frequent international travellers."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I earn reward points on fuel spends through Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME?",
        "a": "No, fuel spends do not earn reward points on Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME. However, you can save up to Rs. 1,200 every year on fuel through 1% fuel surcharge waiver."
      },
      {
        "q": "What are the reward benefits offered by Landmark Rewards SBI Card PRIME?",
        "a": "The card offers 6.25% rewards on Landmark stores and 2.5% rewards on dining, movies, and international spends. It also offers milestone benefits of 20,000 bonus points and additional rewards through welcome and renewal benefits."
